  ⎇ main | (+0,-0)                        Model: Opus 5 | Ctx: 36.3k
  Total: 36.3k                         Session: 3m | Block: 4hr 29m
  ⏵⏵ bypass permissions on (shift+tab to cycle) · ← for agents"""

# Captured by pressing esc during a tool call. Interrupting generation
# instead leaves no marker at all - it just restores the prompt - so this
# is the only shape that reaches the interrupted state.
CLAUDE_INTERRUPTED = """● Background command "Sleep for 60 seconds" completed (exit code 0)

